<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo sets 500 million mark 3-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo sets 500 million mark 3-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/32 PCT  PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.08    FULL FEES   18 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	IHS SERIES 48</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
